Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.99,0:00:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.23,0:00:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.23,0:01:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,He's getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.41,0:01:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to get our hands on one\Nof those Obelisk magic cards!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.13,0:01:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a little more!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.73,0:01:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all your fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.55,0:01:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.46,0:01:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy, I'm falling!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.43,0:01:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.03,0:01:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they ever going to come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.67,0:01:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.15,0:01:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's them!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.33,0:01:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you they'd come back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.01,0:02:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, you're here. So I\Nguess you won. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.43,0:02:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,My Yugi always wins
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.37,0:02:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.05,0:02:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Is everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.69,0:02:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Not quite We got a problem, guys
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.51,0:02:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.25,0:02:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi didn't win. He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.47,0:02:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.53,0:02:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi got beat,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.01,0:02:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya, you're wrong. If Yugi really\Nlost that duel, those creeps
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.09,0:02:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,would have taken his soul\Nwith their freaky magic card,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.53,0:02:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan So,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.91,0:02:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,what's your point, Taya?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.89,0:02:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,My point?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.85,0:02:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If he's lost, how could\Nhe be standing right...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.79,0:02:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Behind me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.05,0:02:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, Yugi, talk to me. What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.49,0:02:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you acting so strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.01,0:02:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca They got him Got who?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.65,0:02:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.35,0:03:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.53,0:03:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.27,0:03:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It only needs one of us, so I'm\Nletting the seal take me instead!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.97,0:03:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.89,0:03:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.13,0:03:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This whole thing's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.77,0:03:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who unleashed the\Nmagic that took Yugi away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.15,0:03:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You knew that card was evil\Nand you still played it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.57,0:03:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,If you really were a brave pharaoh,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.63,0:03:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,you would never have done something\Nlike that to poor little Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.29,0:03:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,This just isn't fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.25,0:03:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.65,0:03:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I want my Yugi back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.71,0:03:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It should have been you, not him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.67,0:03:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Now hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.07,0:03:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.61,0:03:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid Rebecca's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.31,0:03:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What's done is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.53,0:03:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I let everyone down, especially Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.75,0:03:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He warned me not to use the\NSeal of Ori Kalkos card.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.57,0:04:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But my rage took control.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.79,0:04:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I activate the Seal of Ori Kalkos!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.89,0:04:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,He paid for my mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.77,0:04:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta snap out of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.13,0:04:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone, and it's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.85,0:04:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Get a grip, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.07,0:04:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.07,0:04:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,If we're gonna rescue Yugi, we\Ngotta move ahead, not look back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.05,0:04:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,So pull yourself together!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.09,0:04:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What we gotta do now is find out who this
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.61,0:04:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,darts guy is and where\Nhe keeps all these souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.51,0:04:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been suggesting we do that since\Nday one, but nobody listens to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.11,0:04:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop thinking about yourself\Nfor once, Duke! Down, boy. Heel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.25,0:04:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Let him go, Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.87,0:04:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,This happened because I\Ncouldn't control my anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.09,0:04:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And if we keep fighting amongst\Nourselves, the Ori Kalkos will destroy us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.25,0:05:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.23,0:05:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be their\Nheadquarters down there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.85,0:05:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But we're smack in the middle of downtown.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.53,0:05:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And they're a secret society.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.93,0:05:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to sound disrespectful,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.89,0:05:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,guys, but why does a super evil\Norganization have such a super lame hideout?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.63,0:05:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to make it to your next\Nbirthday, I suggest shutting up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.69,0:05:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You're about to meet our master,\Nso don't say anything too stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.01,0:05:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he doesn't have as\Nmuch patience as we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.89,0:05:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Mission accomplished, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.91,0:05:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna become supervillains!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.11,0:06:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be happy to know the strongest soul\Non Earth has been captured, Master Darts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.21,0:06:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes. The Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.91,0:06:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh? What Pharaoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.17,0:06:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, you failed again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.59,0:06:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.91,0:06:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The soul of the Pharaoh's\Nstill out there, Raphael.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.29,0:06:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Now watch and learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.21,0:06:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.83,0:06:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The pharaoh's spirit inhabits\Nthe body of a young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.51,0:06:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And what we have here is a\Nclear case of mistaken identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.95,0:06:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.63,0:06:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead of the pharaoh, you\Ngot the soul of some kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.11,0:06:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I still don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.49,0:06:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you need to clean out your\Nears, you oversized baboon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.87,0:06:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Both of their spirits\Ninhabit one body. Get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.65,0:06:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You captured the wrong soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.85,0:06:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.57,0:07:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure I was dueling the pharaoh,\Nso the Oricalko should have sealed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.71,0:07:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, apparently you're not as perceptive\Nas you think you are, because he got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.73,0:07:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.91,0:07:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no one to blame but yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.71,0:07:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I can fix this, if you'll let me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.19,0:07:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go! Go where?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.05,0:07:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd I suggest something, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.49,0:07:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a better hideout? Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.33,0:07:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just trying to be helpful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.63,0:07:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are these two?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.21,0:07:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't you heard of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.81,0:07:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Former regional Duel Monsters champions?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.23,0:07:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,They're just a couple of wannabe\Nduelists who followed us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.75,0:07:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,They probably never even played the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.43,0:07:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Never played the game?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.23,0:07:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Wannabes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.41,0:07:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We're great duelists, but we\Ncame here to become even better.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.53,0:07:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi and his friends have been\Nmaking fools of us for years!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.97,0:07:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Summon Skull!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.51,0:07:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Lightning Strike Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.05,0:08:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Go! Time Wizard!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.43,0:08:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I've tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.39,0:08:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This'll never work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.25,0:08:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I stand corrected.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.59,0:08:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Before they showed up, we ruled the duels.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.81,0:08:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But lately it seems like we're\Njust the butt of everyone's jokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.95,0:08:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And no one likes being a butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.13,0:08:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What he means is, we want nothing\Nmore than to have our revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.15,0:08:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So please, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.05,0:08:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Dart, sir, share your dueling secrets with\Nus and we'll help you get what you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.79,0:08:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.77,0:08:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.37,0:08:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The Pharaoh and his little friends wield\Nthe power of the legendary dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.83,0:08:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you intend to fight\Nagainst cards like those?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.67,0:08:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That's exactly why we need your help, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.57,0:09:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we need the Seal of Aurichalcos.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.85,0:09:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Before I share my power with you,\NI have to make sure you're worthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.45,0:09:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Give us a chance to prove it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.45,0:09:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.83,0:09:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.09,0:09:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,These are for you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.93,0:09:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this, some kind of joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.47,0:09:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, we're serious about this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.91,0:09:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That makes three of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.05,0:09:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.47,0:09:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Your test.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.83,0:09:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,These crystals from the Aurichalcos\Nstone will activate your cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.11,0:09:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But I stink at tests. No fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.87,0:09:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,All you have to do is hold the\Nrock fragments in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.25,0:09:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,If they deem you worthy of their\Npower, you'll be able to grasp them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.83,0:10:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But if they don't,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.21,0:10:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,you will have to pay the price by offering
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.71,0:10:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,up your very souls to the great Leviathan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.39,0:10:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.97,0:10:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Told you these guys were weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.21,0:10:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring on the test! Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.55,0:10:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,we're not gonna let a\Ncouple of rocks stand
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.35,0:10:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,in our way of becoming champion duelists,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.77,0:10:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.68,0:10:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right! Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.95,0:10:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready? Ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.53,0:10:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't grab the stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.27,0:10:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.61,0:10:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,These twerps aren't worthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.75,0:10:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that I'm surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.61,0:10:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should rethink this whole\Njoining the bad guys thing. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.33,0:10:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,If you fail this test, you're going\Nto be a loser your whole life, Rex!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.51,0:11:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Now get that rock! We're close?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.53,0:11:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a little more!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.41,0:11:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.41,0:11:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Those Nimrods actually passed the test!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.59,0:11:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we can play the Seal of Aurichalcos!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.19,0:11:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be unstoppable!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.49,0:11:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, and\Nwelcome to our family.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.93,0:11:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, Twerps.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.43,0:11:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to build your new decks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.01,0:11:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We've assembled every Duel\NMonsters card ever produced.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.49,0:11:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,So have a party.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.73,0:11:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We've hit the mother lode!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.93,0:11:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We can take anything, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.25,0:11:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you can take anything\Nexcept the Egyptian god cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.99,0:11:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what do you mean, no god cards?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.39,0:11:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, if these cards aren't good\Nenough for you, then use your own deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.89,0:11:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Upon further investigation,\Nthese are perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.97,0:11:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,King of games, eat your heart out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.63,0:12:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now choose wisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.93,0:12:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a difficult task.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.79,0:12:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Deliver to me the soul of the pharaoh\Nand his companion, young Joseph Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.51,0:12:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The Orycalcos is with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.73,0:12:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Use it correctly and\Nvictory is yours. Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.21,0:12:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,So they want to rule the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.13,0:12:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We've dealt with that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.11,0:12:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.37,0:12:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,This time things are different.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.63,0:12:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they're not just talking\Nabout wiping out all life on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.11,0:12:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,They're doing it, but we\Nknow how to stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.53,0:12:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta go straight to the source and\Ndestroy that secret weapon of theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.93,0:12:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean, that weird\Nmonster zapper in the sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.07,0:12:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, that thing's\Nafter more than just monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.29,0:12:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's using human souls to power itself up\Nso it can wipe out the rest of us. Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.81,0:13:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,and right now that thing's got\NYugi, so I don't know about you,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.75,0:13:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm not gonna stand\Nhere twiddling my thumbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.45,0:13:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna take action. Look, Joey,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.77,0:13:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to help Yugi, too, but we can't\Njust fight this thing by ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.17,0:13:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,We need help. No, Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.27,0:13:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,In case you forgot,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.79,0:13:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,those jerks burned down my grandpa's\Nlaboratory and destroyed all his research.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.67,0:13:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And without any hard evidence, there's\Nno way anyone's gonna believe our story.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.97,0:13:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But we have proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.53,0:13:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all down in those underwater ruins.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.63,0:13:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever was there won't\Nbe of any help to us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.89,0:13:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The ruins are gone, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.23,0:13:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone ruined the ruins?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.55,0:13:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,They're one step ahead of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.09,0:13:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.99,0:13:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Gramps, you're awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.47,0:13:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, shouldn't you be resting?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.23,0:13:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.53,0:13:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, who could sleep with\Nyou kids chit-chatting all day?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.73,0:13:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, I can help you find\Nthe information you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.37,0:13:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right about looking\Nto the ruins for answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.71,0:13:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,So, did you discover anything\Nmore about these thugs?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.01,0:13:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I can't be sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.67,0:14:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,but based on the inscriptions I found,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.91,0:14:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,there's a good chance these fellows\Nare descendants of Atlantis,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.89,0:14:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,an ancient continent said\Nto have disappeared into
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.43,0:14:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,the ocean thousands of\Nyears ago without a trace.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.07,0:14:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure? Professor,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.37,0:14:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,if your hunch is right,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.63,0:14:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,why would these people want to destroy\Nwhat was left of their ancestor's city?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.47,0:14:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,They must be trying to hide something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.49,0:14:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Those ruins revealed the history of\NAtlantis, and it's not a pleasant one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.39,0:14:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,They must want to keep it a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.95,0:14:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,How much of this history do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.81,0:14:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Thousands of years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.23,0:14:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Atlantis was home to the most advanced\Ncivilization the world had ever known.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.89,0:14:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It truly was a paradise on Earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.47,0:14:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,a land of eternal tranquility\Nwhere everyone lived in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.31,0:14:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Until one day,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.65,0:14:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,when a dreadful creature was called forth
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.71,0:14:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,from the depths of the\NEarth by an evil king.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.25,0:14:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,An evil king?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.01,0:14:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.53,0:14:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.23,0:15:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,How you ruled as an evil\Nking, you may have forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.97,0:15:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're the one responsible\Nfor the destruction of Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.09,0:15:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? You okay? I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.21,0:15:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems this power-hungry king drew his\Nevil strength from a mysterious stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.75,0:15:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And this stone drew its\Nstrength from another world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.25,0:15:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's that rock they wear\Non their neck, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.81,0:15:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.29,0:15:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all I was able to translate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.45,0:15:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Chill out, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.71,0:15:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll blow a gasket.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.19,0:15:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys don't get it, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.05,0:15:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Those Atlantis freaks are trying to cover
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.13,0:15:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,something up about this ancient\Nmega monster. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.81,0:15:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,There was probably something\Nwritten in those ruins
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.03,0:15:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,about how to destroy that\Nthing before it destroys us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.13,0:15:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.23,0:15:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Joey, I guess you had\Nyour good idea for the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.31,0:15:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The ruins may have been destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.45,0:15:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,but there are copies of the\Ninscriptions at a museum.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.91,0:15:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's in Florida, where I was doing\Nmy underwater research. Perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.47,0:16:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So all we have to do is go there\Nand translate the rest. Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.91,0:16:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are we waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.87,0:16:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head to the Sunshine\NState and find out the
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.23,0:16:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,secret to defeating these\Nguys and saving Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.77,0:16:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.68,0:16:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm right behind you, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.85,0:16:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye to Death Valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.39,0:16:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello to fun in the sun. That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.19,0:16:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one question, how are\Nwe supposed to get there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.81,0:16:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We're doomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.03,0:16:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since these monster sightings began,\NKyber Corp's stock's been plummeting, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.81,0:16:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And almost half of our company's\Nbeen bought by some unknown investor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.73,0:16:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I know who it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.87,0:16:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But just to be sure, I need you to\Ntrace those transactions immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.43,0:16:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And when you do, I'm sure they'll\Npoint straight to Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.01,0:16:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He's been after my company for years,\Nand I'd sooner see it destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.95,0:16:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, Seto, I'm not so sure\Nit's Pegasus who's doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.43,0:16:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, couldn't it be Alistair?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.83,0:16:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,He was pretty upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.73,0:17:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, see this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.15,0:17:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It used to be my brother's,\Nbut I'll never see him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.57,0:17:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Because your father took him away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.91,0:17:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,He blames Kaiba Corp for\Nwhat happened to his brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.43,0:17:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And if I were Alistar, I'd\Nprobably blame this company, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.57,0:17:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, Yugi said Pegasus had his soul\Ncaptured, so he can't be behind this Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.09,0:17:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba, I don't know about\Nall that Pegasus nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.01,0:17:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,but you do bring up a\Ngood point about Alistar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.79,0:17:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So you agree? Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.99,0:17:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.59,0:17:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.75,0:17:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Wheeler on the line for you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.39,0:17:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.15,0:17:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, great. Put him through.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.61,0:17:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.21,0:17:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,He really took your call? What? He did?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.87,0:17:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Diva!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.85,0:17:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that you in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.41,0:17:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It works better when you\Nstep back from the webcam.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.61,0:17:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.05,0:18:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.37,0:18:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Make it fast, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.93,0:18:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We found some clues\Nabout those biker punks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.83,0:18:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of clues?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.57,0:18:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not giving them up that easily, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.37,0:18:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you give us a lift to\NFlorida, I'll fill you in on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.67,0:18:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So what's it gonna be?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.27,0:18:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Time is running out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.87,0:18:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Those creeps defeated\NYugi and took his soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.13,0:18:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to keep a secret, lame brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.45,0:18:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's soul?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.51,0:18:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.77,0:18:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Please disregard my last statement, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.01,0:18:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.47,0:18:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba doesn't believe in\Nall that magic stuff anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.35,0:18:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's all some kind\Nof Hocus Pocus mind trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.79,0:18:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that sounds just like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.97,0:18:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.01,0:18:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi gave his Duel Monsters\NChampionship crown to some nobody?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.85,0:18:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No one deserves that title but me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.17,0:19:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.13,0:19:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear another word.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.89,0:19:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a disgrace to the game, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.41,0:19:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.63,0:19:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.09,0:19:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I have one more incentive to\Nhunt down and destroy those thugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.03,0:19:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.93,0:19:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Ride, that stinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.45,0:19:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.61,0:19:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,How are we supposed to\Nget down to Florida now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.95,0:19:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I say the professor stays\Nhere, and we hop the next flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.09,0:19:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right, Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.49,0:19:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Running around the country is not\Nthe best thing for you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.01,0:19:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Duke, why don't you stay here\Nand keep an eye on the professor?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.75,0:19:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.66,0:19:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So I guess a private jet is\Nout of the question, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.53,0:19:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll book our flights, and we'll\Ntake a train to the airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.67,0:19:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I just hope we can save\NYugi before it's too late.
